{"synopsis":"Ketika aku sadar kembali setelah kecelakaan mobil, saya menjadi saudara tiri dari penjahat dalam “My Beloved Santa.” Setelah memiliki tubuh ini, saya memutuskan untuk membuka jalan bunga untuk mencegah penjahat menjadi orang yang gelap. Saya bekerja keras dengan sepenuh hati dan segenap kekuatan saya… Entah bagaimana, saya terjerat dengan Duke of Lexerville, yang terkenal sebagai orang gila yang haus darah. “Bukankah aku sudah memperingatkanmu saat itu bahwa aku tidak akan melepaskanmu jika kau melakukan hal yang bodoh?” Ketika dia melihat saya dengan pria lain, dia menginterogasi saya seolah-olah dia memergoki pacar yang selingkuh.","alternative_title":"언니는 여동생을 바르게 키워야 합니다","author":"Dok Yeon, Mana Studio","artist":"Danbam","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"84b3fe24-dccf-40c3-af6c-c8bc0478a811","number":"157","chapter":"157","title":"Chapter 157","date":"2026-07-31","released":"2026-07-31","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"651aba13-61e0-45d5-81ef-8a67464780cc","number":"156","chapter":"156","title":"Chapter 156","date":"2026-07-25","released":"2026-07-25","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"2babdc47-8241-457c-9232-ee3de82f7aeb","number":"155","chapter":"155","title":"Chapter 155","date":"2026-07-22","released":"2026-07-22","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"12022455-f716-45c4-8024-1a64c7bccb90","number":"154","chapter":"154","title":"Chapter 154","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"538ad207-8560-4c0e-9091-690ddddcf3ee","number":"153","chapter":"153","title":"Chapter 153","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"5a854a10-50bb-4b16-8f3c-5371230c0726","number":"152","chapter":"152","title":"Chapter 152","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"0f20933f-00e5-4c90-9d94-e10a00c10fe6","number":"151","chapter":"151","title":"Chapter 151","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"49917682-3980-44d9-8245-b6a709d2cb5c","number":"150","chapter":"150","title":"Chapt